> confident I am with my +3 elven dagger. Should I be ok to try and
> stand up to the Vampire in melee? I really really don't want to risk
> level drain. Should I just use my scroll of teleport and avoid that
> area?

Meh.  If you have MC3 (elven cloak or most magic cloaks aside from
displacement) then you can probably just melee him.

You're better off doing the hit-move-move thing to be safer, or abuse
finger-E and missile weapons.  If hp gets below half, read the scroll
or zap him with the wand of teleport.  Once you have a free move,
consider pulling out /fire or /lightning and use that instead of /
teleport if things get even slightly tight.


